fect.\n\t\tAt talent level 5 Sleep will become contagious and has a 25%% chance to spread to nearby targets each turn.\n\t\tThe damage threshold will scale with your Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"使 %d 码半径范围内的目标陷入 %d 回合的睡眠状态中，使它们无法行动。它们每承受 %d 点伤害，睡眠的持续时间减少一回合。\n\t\t当睡眠结束时，目标会饱受失眠的痛苦，持续回合等于已睡眠的回合数（但最多 10 回合），失眠状态的每一个剩余回合数会让目标获得 %d%% 睡眠免疫。\n\t\t在等级 5 时，睡眠会具有传染性，每回合有 25%% 几率传播向附近的目标。\n\t\t受精神强度影响，伤害临界点按比例加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d569254fe0e47f71ff728df6f8eae8af0e855911d74246b98aa3142538e47f44","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"36e60f98e946e2b8eb69ee1225295b90b2266ae68a28cbe45378c7548ef403b9","logical_entry_identity":"f9517487fb5ebafa8281178965d486f29ed1d64a1e7564377e92ff33bdfdfc1e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Facial Runes 3","source_tag":"_t","target":"脸部符文3"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"089335bf274ea8600b2524f48aafff19a5e6b9b6c104e4253de46571080c0c51","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"36ead8142fceb64ae2769ff6663f2edd508abfe5df4fa2e5e7731619b505de1c","logical_entry_identity":"cca4d3f7bf8952ff70bda1bfbb92e4a2dcf759f942aa90e801b9806f8b70c27a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Reduces fire damage received by %d%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"受到的火焰伤害降低 %d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"22c50027fcb84c413bed461052075bf5a92e8e3aae7a2561c1abafe50bd82d38","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"36eae827a194986d77e6c1a90596f4e638026cf002b4edd247ab02751b6e70e4","logical_entry_identity":"369059e25e538855c551cd959db4d326a07bb4ac85d708f96f8e0ec13719b5f5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The heart seems to absorb light when you deal darkness damage. Standing on unlit tiles, you feel stronger.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这颗心脏在你造成黑暗伤害的时候会吸收光亮。站在未照亮的方格上，你会变得更强。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"66444e9f666eeea29730d9366ed397528ac71f240d9e62d1c9086d301749f2cc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"36ecae6e496cf489eeafd15ccce82b66423bc79ecf81f0f94fad9223dd24a3cd"